{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921221819_eda8683b","chunk_index":13,"job_id":"mwjob_bf28987c132c1b13527f252a","precondition_digest":"67d537499c47fe4ae0d786ec4ac18714b2af7d64fc584e8f1b34e1d9f712899a","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v5","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_42f4fa79abc0cfdc","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b2568b149c433676","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b1a29c067cba5951","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_060d398405a8454b"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921221819_eda8683b","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_42f4fa79abc0cfdc","fact_path":"picos.study_epochs","options":[{"label":"首次给药至安全性随访结束","option_id":"opt_ae_window_treatment_followup","summary":"自首次给药起持续收集并随访不良事件，至第20周安全性随访结束，与研究访视安排一致。"},{"label":"自签署知情同意书起收集","option_id":"opt_ae_window_icf","summary":"自签署知情同意书后开始收集，首次给药前仅收集与研究流程相关的不良事件，其余作为病史记录。"},{"label":"仅双盲治疗期收集","option_id":"opt_ae_window_treatment_only","summary":"仅将16周双盲治疗期内发生的不良事件纳入正式安全性数据集，安全性随访期仅收集严重不良事件。"}],"question":"不良事件的收集时间窗与随访要求应如何界定？","rationale":"本研究访视策略包含第20周安全性随访，推荐将不良事件收集与随访边界与该访视框架统一；其余选项涉及给药前收集范围或随访期仅收集严重不良事件，需医学作者结合安全性管理要求确认。","recommended_option_id":"opt_ae_window_treatment_followup"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_42f4fa79abc0cfdc\n章节编号=8.2.1\n章节标题=不良事件","quote_sha256":"ea8613ef84b26ec8f5a843d0529118b70cf0bfd0a1e135779e95125613f6b759","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","span_id":"span_sec_821"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_epochs"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_safety"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sec_821","span_proj_epochs","span_proj_visits","span_proj_safety"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"不良事件","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本试验在16周双盲治疗期及4周安全性随访期内持续开展安全性观察。安全性终点包括治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，并涵盖实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。本章节说明不良事件的定义与范围、严重程度评估、与研究药物的相关性判定、记录内容及随访要求，并明确需要关注的安全性事件类型。对安全性观察期间发生的不良医学事件，应确保及时医学处理并完整记录其临床意义与转归；安全性信息的报告按照适用监管要求执行，以保障受试者安全并支持对合成试验药A安全性的整体评价。","rationale":"已确认的项目事实包括双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周、第20周安全性随访，以及安全性终点覆盖治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件、导致停药的不良事件和实验室检查、生命体征、12导联心电图变化。本章节据此界定安全性观察范围；不良事件的定义、收集起点、随访终点、报告要求及药物过量处理口径需医学作者核对确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_42f4fa79abc0cfdc","section_number":"8.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c4c8ac382dcd25","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6094413da6b90d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:404ba140bf6237","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9abb104d760a32","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921221819_eda8683b","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b2568b149c433676","fact_path":"picos.safety_endpoints","options":[{"label":"按项目统一安全性管理流程","option_id":"opt_sae_project_safety_process","summary":"在确认严重性后，按项目统一的安全性管理流程执行记录、评估、随访与报告，确保各中心操作一致。"},{"label":"按适用监管快速报告要求","option_id":"opt_sae_regulatory_rapid","summary":"严重不良事件在获知后按适用监管要求的快速报告时限提交至相关接收方。"},{"label":"仅规定记录与随访要求","option_id":"opt_sae_record_followup_only","summary":"方案仅规定严重不良事件的记录与随访要求，报告时限与路径依据各机构标准操作规程执行。"}],"question":"严重不良事件的记录与报告要求应如何在方案中确定？","rationale":"现行已确认事实未明确严重不良事件报告时限与接收方；推荐先采用项目统一安全性管理流程以保证多中心执行一致，具体时限与路径由医学作者确认后写入。","recommended_option_id":"opt_sae_project_safety_process"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b2568b149c433676\n章节编号=8.2.2\n章节标题=严重不良事件","quote_sha256":"3e2456ed4c02e8c03d93c3fbfa817293170d7a3761221299907a2e34fb49daf9","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","span_id":"span_sec_822"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_epochs"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_safety"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sec_822","span_proj_epochs","span_proj_safety"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"严重不良事件","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本试验在16周双盲治疗期及4周安全性随访期内收集安全性信息，严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率属于本研究安全性终点的重要组成部分。本章节界定严重不良事件的范围与判定要求，说明其识别、记录、评估、随访与报告应覆盖的环节，并明确与不良事件记录体系的衔接。对研究中发生的严重不良事件，应确保及时医学处理，事件过程、处理措施及转归应完整记录；安全性信息的报告按照适用监管要求执行，以保障受试者安全并支持对合成试验药A安全性的整体评价。","rationale":"已确认的项目事实包括双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周，以及严重不良事件属于安全性终点。本章节据此说明安全性信息收集背景；严重不良事件的具体定义、报告时限、报告接收方、记录表单与随访要求需医学作者核对确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b2568b149c433676","section_number":"8.2.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c4c8ac382dcd25","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6094413da6b90d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:404ba140bf6237","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9abb104d760a32","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921221819_eda8683b","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b1a29c067cba5951","fact_path":"picos.safety_endpoints","options":[{"label":"按适用监管要求快速报告","option_id":"opt_susar_regulatory_rapid","summary":"依据适用的临床试验监管要求，对符合判定标准的事件履行快速报告义务。"},{"label":"按项目安全性管理流程报告","option_id":"opt_susar_project_process","summary":"在本方案安全性管理部分统一规定报告路径与时限，并据此执行。"},{"label":"先依据参考安全性信息评估预期性","option_id":"opt_susar_rsi_first","summary":"以现行参考安全性信息判定事件的非预期性，再按适用要求完成报告。"}],"question":"可疑且非预期严重不良反应的报告路径与时限应如何确定？","rationale":"现有已确认事实未规定可疑且非预期严重不良反应的报告时限与接收方；推荐按适用监管要求执行快速报告，具体路径、时限及参考安全性信息由医学作者确认后写入。","recommended_option_id":"opt_susar_regulatory_rapid"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b1a29c067cba5951\n章节编号=8.2.3\n章节标题=可疑且非预期严重不良反应","quote_sha256":"5088f22d04fadea879e41edecd08d7b208760a986b821c590ba6721738623e6e","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","span_id":"span_sec_823"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_safety"},{"locator":"section:6.2.1 严重不良事件的定义|block:975|chunk:1","quote":"申办者收到任何来源的安全性相关信息后，均应当立即分析评估，包括严重性、与试验药物的相关性以及是否为预期事件等。","quote_sha256":"f9c393885466613978b94e6f2de59364ae7775aee66ff0dfa3439154a9864ea8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c4c8ac382dcd25","span_id":"span_corpus_sae_eval"},{"locator":"section:6.2.1 严重不良事件的定义|block:975|chunk:1","quote":"申办者应当将可疑且非预期严重不良反应快速报告给所有参加临床试验的研究者及临床试验机构、伦理委员会；申办者应当向药品监督管理部门和卫生健康主管部门报告可疑且非预期严重不良反应。","quote_sha256":"498dffad152f755a2393ae45bcd48dabd60a6e1e86afb8aa9670aabcac76ce1a","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c4c8ac382dcd25","span_id":"span_corpus_susar_report"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sec_823","span_proj_safety","span_corpus_sae_eval","span_corpus_susar_report"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"可疑且非预期严重不良反应","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"当严重不良反应的性质、严重程度或转归与现行参考安全性信息不一致时，该事件被判定为可疑且非预期严重不良反应。本章节说明该类事件的识别与评估要求，明确其与严重不良事件记录和报告流程的衔接，并规定应覆盖的报告环节。对被判定为可疑且非预期严重不良反应的事件，应依据适用监管要求履行快速报告义务，报告内容应完整反映事件过程、评估依据及转归，以保障受试者安全并满足安全性信息报告要求。","rationale":"本章节依据严重不良反应的监管框架说明可疑且非预期严重不良反应的识别与报告范围。预期性判定依赖现行参考安全性信息，报告时限、报告接收方及与本项目安全性管理流程的衔接需医学作者确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["正文使用跨项目语料支持研究实施规则；请确认该规则适用于本项目，或改为本项目权威内容。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b1a29c067cba5951","section_number":"8.2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c4c8ac382dcd25","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6094413da6b90d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:404ba140bf6237","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9abb104d760a32","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921221819_eda8683b","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"研究药物相关风险","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）或参考安全性信息","非临床安全性研究资料","既往临床研究安全性数据","同类药物已知风险资料"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"研究药物相关风险需要汇总合成试验药A的已知与潜在风险。已确认的项目事实仅包括小分子技术类型、口服固体制剂、100 mg每日一次、连续16周及系统暴露范围；当前可获取的项目资料未包含研究者手册、非临床安全性数据或既往临床安全性数据，无法在不臆造的前提下生成实质风险描述，按来源缺口处理。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（研究药物相关风险），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_060d398405a8454b","section_number":"8.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c4c8ac382dcd25","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6094413da6b90d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:404ba140bf6237","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9abb104d760a32","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:51f6163dda79affeb96dcfbe","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"fa7762c54a8291b27ee3008c729252db97e02129065a6f4e9b9142af54137b0d"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:6.2.1 严重不良事件的定义|block:975|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c4c8ac382dcd25","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"6f28f7637f6f1ba2077eb1fe8e9ea5ed2ab9ec4c46c8fc22764a3f862d030a9c"},{"locator":"section:6.2.2 严重不良事件的记录和报告|block:979|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6094413da6b90d","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"b83165fd5a357b70d38afaafcc4ac73dd53166ba882714ce6e4e5b0d04388a9a"},{"locator":"section:药物过量|block:777|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:404ba140bf6237","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"53da1fbaff4ec040ed1ea176dc5273dd0a6f0dc04f91c3e968c3e5b8ac7dc33d"},{"locator":"section:排除标准 | 实验室异常|block:92|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9abb104d760a32","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"888fcb2256737ac9d87eb166c0b2f9880c17ad6b7786aad48e772dc4e668d8c5"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:25|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"68663fd612a1770f44cc3c20e025cf77d568a22b8c10c9a906d5ceb40702d87e"}]}